OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of occasionally heavy
OL,6,Frain in the morning then dry for a
OL,7,Ftime with some bright spells in the
OL,8,Fafternoon. More heavy showers will
OL,9,Fthen spread from the west later. Fresh
OL,10,Fto strong southerly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy evening with
OL,13,Fsome showers. Then turning drier
OL,14,Fovernight with some clear intervals,
OL,15,Fjust the odd shower in Argyll.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,18,Fsome sunny spells. There will also be
OL,19,Fa few showers, turning heavier in the
OL,20,Fafternoon. Strong to gale southwest
OL,21,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
