OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FShowery on Tuesday with strong
OL,7,Fwesterly winds. Showers dying out on
OL,8,FWednesday with some sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Rain spreading from west
OL,10,Fon Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
